**Step 2: Update indenting**. Described in [Indenting](http://style.tidyverse.org/syntax.html#indenting) section. It also seems appropriate to always place clause of individual `if` (not a small one as function output) on separate line using `{}`. In function calls and hierarchical structures indentation should increase by two spaces and be placed on a new line. Closing bracket `)` should be on a separate line with indentation level of start of function call.

